# Memory Lapse: "If that spell is countered this way, put it on top of its owner's library". Abrupt Decay "can't be countered":
# the Memory Lapse resolves and counters nothing, so the Decay is not moved to the library; it resolves, destroys Bot2's Mox
# Sapphire and goes to the graveyard, and Bot1's library is untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Jet
Abrupt Decay
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Memory Lapse
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Abrupt Decay.Cast(Mox Sapphire)
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Memory Lapse.Cast(Abrupt Decay)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Abrupt Decay
Bot1.Library.Count = 7
Bot2.Battlefield = Island
Bot2.Graveyard = Mox Sapphire; Memory Lapse
